WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:34.500
[Instrumental Intro]

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:38.500
Woke up this morning, the world was gray

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:42.500
Didn't know the colors had all faded away

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:46.400
Been living in a room with the curtains drawn tight

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:50.800
