00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:55.500
Leaving the terrestrial shadow behind

00:00:55.600 --> 00:01:04.500
Drifting into the spectrum we were meant to find!

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:09.200
Oh, I'm seeing in electric color!

00:01:09.300 --> 00:01:13.200
Finding a rhythm I never knew!

00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:17.200
Floating in a brand new summer

00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:21.500
The whole cosmos feels bright and new!

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:25.200
It's an electric-colored feeling

00:01:25.300 --> 00:01:30.000
Suspended in the velvet with you!

00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:45.200
